title: Seeckt's Decree
subtitle: The general with emergency powers bans the parties of both extremes.
new-page: true
tags: event
view-if: year = 1923 and month >= 11 and crisis = 0 and e23_ban_done = 0 and beer_hall_putsch = 1
max-visits: 1
priority: 2
on-arrival: {!
Q.e23_ban_done = 1;
var ban = (Q.german_october >= 1 || Q.e23_october_path > 0 || Q.militancy >= 50) ? 1 : 0;
if (Q.e23_red_region > 0 && Q.german_october == 2) { ban = 1; }
Q.kpd_banned = ban;
Q.e23_ban_has_arrests = 0;
if (ban) {
    RG.news('Seeckt bans the Communist Party', 3);
    Q.districts.forEach(function (d) { RG.district(d, {repression: 3, guards: -Q['district_' + d + '_guards'] * 0.3, members: -0.1}); });
    var pool = ['eberlein', 'pieck', 'walcher', 'frolich', 'maslow', 'thalheimer', 'meyer', 'munzenberg'].filter(function (c) { return RG.isFree(c); });
    pool.sort(function () { return Math.random() - 0.5; });
    var taken = pool.slice(0, 2);
    taken.forEach(function (c) { RG.arrest(c, 6, {quiet: true}); });
    Q.e23_ban_arrested = taken.map(function (c) { return RG.comradeName(c); }).join(' and ');
    Q.e23_ban_has_arrests = taken.length ? 1 : 0;
    Q.repression += 12;
} else {
    Q.repression += 4;
    RG.news('Seeckt bans the National Socialists; the communists stay legal', 3);
}
Q.nsdap_exists = 1;
Q.sa_strength *= 0.6;
!}

= Seeckt's Decree

On the night of the Munich putsch President Ebert hands executive power in the whole Reich to General von Seeckt. On 23 November Seeckt bans the National Socialists and the German Völkisch Freedom Party.

[? if kpd_banned = 1 : The same decree bans the Communist Party. The police seal the offices and the printing works in a single night, and *Die Rote Fahne* does not appear in the morning. Our deputies keep their immunity. ?][? if e23_ban_has_arrests = 1 : [+ e23_ban_arrested +] are taken in the first raids. ?][? if kpd_banned = 0 : We are not on the list. The party took no part in a rising, the SPD has said it would leave the government over a ban, and Stresemann does not want martyrs. The political police keep their files up to date all the same. ?]

- @cells: Rebuild the party in cells of five.
- @courts: Fight the ban in the courts.
- @defy: Print *Die Rote Fahne* under a new name every week.
- @recruit: Recruit the workers who have left the SPD.

@cells
subtitle: A smaller party that can be trusted. The cells will be harder for the police to find.
view-if: kpd_banned = 1
on-arrival: {!
Q.e23_cells = 1;
Q.unity += 4;
Q.districts.forEach(function (d) { RG.district(d, {members: -0.05}); });
!}

Every member knows four others and the courier. The leaflets are printed in a cellar in Moabit and handed out at the factory gates before six.

@courts
subtitle: [? if lock_united_front = 1 : Against the party line: costs Unity. ?] Slow. The SPD's lawyers will help, and Zinoviev will call it legalism.
view-if: kpd_banned = 1
choose-if: lock_united_front < 2
unavailable-subtitle: The [+ leading_faction_adj +] line forbids asking the Social Democrats for help.
on-arrival: {!
if (!RG.e22) { this._runActions(this.game.scenes.e22_lib.onArrival); }
RG.e22.against('united_front');
Q.repression -= 5;
Q.spd_relation += 4;
RG.ecci('zinoviev', -4);
!}

[? if levi_split = 1 : Paul Levi is the first to speak against the ban in the Reichstag, from the SPD benches. ?] A judge in Leipzig unseals two of our presses before Christmas. The rest stay sealed.

@defy
subtitle: Every edition is seized, and somebody goes to prison for each one.
view-if: kpd_banned = 1
on-arrival: {!
var more = ['fischer', 'thalmann', 'maslow', 'pieck', 'meyer'].filter(function (c) { return RG.isFree(c); });
if (more.length) { RG.arrest(more[0], 6); }
Q.districts.forEach(function (d) { RG.district(d, {repression: 4, militancy: 3}); });
Q.worker_support += 2;
!}

The paper comes out as *Die Fahne*, then as *Der Rote Stern*, then as *Die Fackel*. The police seize most copies at the station. Enough of them get through.

@recruit
subtitle: The SPD members are angry with their own party, and some of them are ready to join.
view-if: kpd_banned = 0
on-arrival: {!
Q.districts.forEach(function (d) { RG.district(d, {members: 0.05}); });
Q.worker_support += 3;
!}

All through December our meetings are full of men with SPD badges in their pockets. A good number of them sign the card at the door.
